ent Agreement' [P9], and the percentages do match [P13] and [P3]. However, because the fee amounts stated (£3,305.55 and £1,101.85) rest on an undocumented transfer value of £110,185 that conflicts with the report's own figure of £116,998.47, the arithmetic supporting the specific amounts charged is not sound. This is an internal inconsistency in how the report applies its own agreed fee percentages to the client's actual position. The services described in the report match those in the Client Agreement [P3] and [P5]. The Client Agreement confirms the fees are exclusive of VAT unless stated otherwise [P12]; the report does not disclose VAT treatment. The agreement was duly executed on 31/10/2025 [P11], after the report date of 14/10/2025, confirming the fees were agreed.","citations":[{"passageId":"P12","source":"TFAS Wealth Client Agreement Privacy.md","category":"A","quote":"The fees you are required to pay for our advisory services are set out in the suitability report and any subsequent charges confirmation. You will need to provide confirmation of your acceptance by approving them expressly or by written consent. For investments, we arrange and oversee on your behalf, there are two principal fees. A fee based on the work we do to arrange the initial investment, and a fee based upon any ongoing reviews which we will do on your behalf.","cells":null},{"passageId":"P13","source":"IMPORT_2.md","category":"A","quote":"There will be a charge of 3% of the value of the funds that we advise on.","cells":null},{"passageId":"P3","source":"IMPORT_2.md","category":"A","quote":"For most investment funds that we transact on your behalf, we charge an on-going annual review management charge of 1%","cells":null},{"passageId":"P5","source":"Suitability Report Test 1.md","category":"I","quote":"The costs for this service are 1% per annum. Based on current values & expected contributions, minus the initial fee, this would be equal to circa £1,101.85 for the first year.","cells":null},{"passageId":"P9","source":"Suitability Report Test 1.md","category":"I","quote":"For researching, recommending and arranging these investments, we charge an initial advice fee of 3% of the amount invested as per the terms stated in our Client Agreement. In monetary terms this is £3,305.55 with current transfer values","cells":null},{"passageId":"P11","source":"TFAS Wealth Client Agreement Privacy.md","category":"A","quote":"Signed by client1_eDocSignature ... 31/10/2025","cells":["client1_eDocSignature","31/10/2025"]},{"passageId":"P12","source":"TFAS Wealth Client Agreement Privacy.md","category":"A","quote":"Value added tax (VAT), unless otherwise stated, our fees and charges are exclusive of any applicable VAT","cells":null}],"issueCategories":["Data inconsistency","Disclosure shortfall"],"severity":"Moderate","outcome":"PotentialConcern"}

